{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-29T20:35:41.836Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6bf23ca256a5142e59ec9539","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1627"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1627: bound the entire next response and compact optional TOON sections losslessly"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1627\n\nReported behavior on published2026.10.28; current-source reproduction and implementation are pending. Preserve the completed predecessor scope when evaluating this report.\n\nFound while orienting an agent session with pm 2026.10.28 on a real tracker (~400 items, 95 ready).\n\nSeverity: medium (paid on every `pm next`, the first command an agent runs to pick work).\n\n`pm next --limit 5` (TOON, default) prints **6,847 bytes / 72 lines** while its own `filters.token_budget` says **640**. `--token-budget` is documented as bounding only \"the ranked ready\" rows; every other section is unbudgeted and the total cost is never reported. Measured bytes by section:\n\n| Section | Bytes |\n| --- | ---: |\n| `blocked[5]` | 1,821 |\n| `containers[5]` | 1,469 |\n| `ready[5]` (the budgeted part) | 1,331 |\n| `decision_needed[3]` | 947 |\n| `recommended` | 397 |\n| `summary` + `filters` + `held_by_others` + four `*_encoding` blocks | ~780 |\n\nThree avoidable costs inside that:\n\n1. **Side sections ignore the budget and the include flags.** `filters` reports `include_decisions: false` and `include_containers: false`, yet `decision_needed[3]` and `containers[5]` are printed in full (15–18 columns each). Agents read the false flags and the printed sections as a contradiction.\n2. **Escaped tag JSON in TOON rows.** 162 `\\\"` sequences, e.g. `\"[\\\"hosted\\\",\\\"tests\\\",\\\"website\\\"]\"`, plus a `json_columns` `*_encoding` block per section. #1603 removed this from `pm context`; `pm next` still has it.\n3. **All-null columns.** 63 `,null` cells (`order`, `deadline`, `assignee`, `parent` are null in almost every row) across the four tables.\n\nExpected (same contract #1401 gave `pm context`): one budget covers the whole response, or the response reports its own total `estimated_tokens` with a per-section breakdown. Side sections collapse to counts plus ids unless explicitly requested (`--include-decisions` / `--include-containers` / `--blocked-limit`). Tags render as TOON arrays, and columns that are null in every row are omitted with an absent-columns receipt. A contract test that `pm next` output stays within `--token-budget` (± a declared envelope) on a large fixture would keep this from regressing.\n"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","github","sdk"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-29T20:35:41.836Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-29T20:35:41.836Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":180},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Independently measure the reported large ready-work fixture; Account for every response section and total output cost; Honor explicit side-section includes and preserve resumability; Verify lossless tag encoding null-column receipts and JSON/TOON contracts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-5t33or"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The complete next response discloses and obeys its effective budget, respects include controls, and preserves tags/null omission receipts without changing full SDK data."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1603","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-10-29T20:35:41.836Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-29T20:35:41.836Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check: complete strict all-status corpus3157 with no omissions or unreadable records, request-specific GH-number and semantic searches, current open/in_progress inventories, and full live predecessor data/comments/history. The predecessor scope is delivered; this report names a distinct boundary. New intake is open and unclaimed. Source report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1627"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"fdb180404d78c60b629003cca5f86ffb00b111c5f37eba26ffaa2495d98134bc","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0822a521abd73e47bb9aa451c97adaa93aed12c6cb864b2a0c33a0fe2638afad"}
