{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-31T01:51:58.339Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-1","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"fe411f5ac7c0c68c436d07f8","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-1","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"release-operator","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1610","claim:pm-gh1627","release:pm-gh1628"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1610+pm-gh1627","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1610","claim:pm-gh1627","release:pm-gh1628"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.314","source":"probe"}},"op":"close","patch":[{"op":"remove","path":"/metadata/assignee"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-31T01:51:58.339Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/status","value":"closed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/closed_at","value":"2026-10-31T01:51:58.329Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/completed_at","value":"2026-10-31T01:51:58.329Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/resolution","value":"The TOON codec records omitted null columns by position (null_column_index) instead of repeating the full column list, so the compact table wins for ready and containers and every pm next section list-encodes tags. --token-budget on next is no longer a read-output cost alias, so the universal default ceiling keeps binding the complete response; requesting a selection budget audits the whole envelope (read_output with budget_source default, budget_tokens and estimated_tokens beside truncation.ready_budget) unless an enforced intent receipt already discloses it; filters.token_budget echoes the requested selection ceiling or null. SDK surface snapshot acknowledges NextResult.filters.token_budget (number|null) and PmTableCellEncoding.null_column_index; docs/COMMANDS.md and docs/AGENT_OUTPUT_ENCODINGS.md describe the two budget scopes."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Measured on the real tracker (229 open, 112 ready): pm next --limit 5 TOON 9,148 -> 8,718 bytes, escaped-quote sequences 182 -> 76 (the remainder is the blockers object column on blocked/containers rows), null cells 30 -> 15, all four sections list-encode tags; --token-budget 640 --json now carries read_output {budget_source: default, budget_tokens: 6000, estimated_tokens: 4119, within_budget: true} and filters.token_budget 640; the default run reports token_budget null and no receipt. Include flags remain dispatch opt-ins, documented as such. Token-budget gate (32 surfaces), context-intent calibration, flag-lexicon/parity/grammar gates and the linked test run pass; negative control fails 3 of 3 new tests before the fix."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"pm next discloses and obeys its budgets and encodes tags losslessly"}],"before_hash":"99d5da4efd510b73784f0dcf09687ae60115d9b745167be999b329e866f9a821","after_hash":"6ff4aef5e74205fddfdbe405e2f3306041a421975d96862e3647cd2809fcc1f5","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-10-31T01:51:58.329Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"1f435b10887e3a727c6e23494c5fe13b5dd3922fc5a67a9f2a41d9588f1a389b"}
